@startuml 洪水链路方向退化差异
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title 洪水链路上传与下载的退化形态:上传吞吐滑坡 vs 下载趋向失败

participant "时间轴" as T

== 上传方向:吞吐滑坡,硬扛到底 ==

T -> T  : 子包 #1 发送(44ms) + 节流(50ms)
T -> T  : ZRPOS 往返 + 本地缓存重发
T -> T  : 子包 #2 ... (同模式重复)
T -> T  : 有效吞吐跌至 1/3 以下\n但传输持续向前推进
note over T
  上传:RetransmitController
  本地弹药不计次数,
  退化形态 = 慢,而非失败
end note

== 下载方向:双重命中,趋向失败 ==

T -> T  : 设备侧 sz 发送被 printk 打断
T -> T  : ZRPOS 恢复链双向趟洪水
T -> T  : 重试 1..10 逐次烧穿
T -> T  : MAX_CRC_RETRIES 烧穿\n传输整体失败
note over T
  下载:发送端暴露在洪水里,
  恢复链路更长且被动,
  退化形态 = 滑坡 + 高概率失败
end note

@enduml
